    "result_text": "The implementation is complete and the build is green.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the customerCode de-duplication rule in `ClinicServiceImpl.java` (`src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/service/ClinicServiceImpl.java`).\n\n**Change:** `generateCustomerCode` now computes the base `<REGION>-<HASH8>` code as before, then passes it through a new `deduplicateCustomerCode` helper:\n\n- It collects all *other* owners' existing `customerCode` values (excluding the owner being saved).\n- If the base code is unused, it returns it unchanged.\n- On collision, it appends `-<n>` starting at `n = 2` and increments until it finds an unused value, then returns that de-duplicated code.\n\nThis guarantees distinct owners always get distinct customer codes, matching the spec and the `AcceptanceTest.coreCustomerCodesStayUnique` assertion.\n\n**Test result:** `BUILD SUCCESS` \u2014 `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0`.",
